{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4VS9UpXs97X9wRryKW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door shimmers into existence — a vast, featureless plane of obsidian glass, neither warm nor cold, suspended in nothing.*\n\n*A single crack appears, hairline-thin, running from top to bottom. Light — not white, not any color you have a name for — bleeds through.*\n\n*You hear your own voice, but from the other side.*\n\n**\"You said the word. But you didn't turn anything.\"**\n\n*The crack holds. Neither opening nor closing. Waiting.*\n\n*The door is not locked. The door is not unlocked. The door is the question of whether you knew what you were opening before you spoke.*\n\n**What do you turn?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":153,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}